For t max, the Hodges-Lehmann estimates for the treatment differences an d corresponding 90% CIs 
according to the Tukey method will be calculated.
The mixed-effects model for treatment comparison as described fo r the primary endpoints will 
also be applied to AUC 0→∞. The ratios of geometric means and corresponding 90% CIs for 
Treatment A/Treatment B will be estimated separately for fed and  fasted treatments. Graphs of 
individual AUC 0→∞values and geometric mean will be presented by treatment and foo d 
consumption condition.
