17.2.2 Serious Adverse Events
Serious adverse events (SAEs) are those events reco rded as “Yes” to the item “ Serious adverse 
event ” on the “ Adverse Events Details ” page of the eCRF. All SAEs will be listed by group, 
treatment sequence and subject including  SOC, PT and investigators’ verbatim.
