ANCS (Abnormal, Not Clinically Significant), ACS (Abnormal, Cli nically Significant) and 
Missing will be presented by treatment sequence and overall for ea ch group at the end of study
visit.
12-lead ECG parameters and result of ECG will be listed in indi vidual subject listing by group, 
treatment sequence, subject, visit, treatment and time point. A ll marked abnormal values of ECG 
evaluation will be listed by subj ect, treatment sequence and gr oup. 
